<p>Cursor is a purpose-built AI code editor that goes far beyond simple autocomplete. It understands your entire codebase, lets you edit multiple files at once with natural language, and features a powerful Agent mode that can autonomously implement complex features across your project. Built on VS Code, it integrates seamlessly with existing extensions and workflows while adding deep AI capabilities that make it feel like pair programming with a senior engineer.</p>


<h3>Multi-Dimension Rating</h3>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Overall</th><th>Code Quality</th><th>Speed</th><th>Ease of Use</th><th>Debugging</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐☆</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐☆</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐☆</td><td>⭐⭐⭐⭐☆</td></tr></tbody>
