<tr><td>✔ Built on VS Code with full extension compatibility</td><td>✘ Requires good prompting skills for best results</td></tr>
<tr><td>✔ Tab completion is fast and contextually relevant</td><td>✘ Free tier has limited premium model requests</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

