<h2>5. Replit — 🌟 Best Cloud-Based AI Coding</h2>
<p>Replit is a complete cloud development environment with built-in AI coding assistance. Its AI Agent can build entire applications from a single prompt — generating code, setting up the environment, configuring dependencies, and even deploying. The collaborative features let multiple developers work in the same environment in real time. With zero setup required — just open a browser and start coding — Replit is ideal for beginners, education, and rapid prototyping.</p>


